{"id":"en_i-died-in-a-glass-coffin-and-my-brothers-lost-their-minds","title":"I Died in a Glass Coffin, and My Brothers Lost Their Minds","titleEn":"I Died in a Glass Coffin, and My Brothers Lost Their Minds","description":"Chloe, an orphan, is reunited with her wealthy brothers, only for their adopted sister Sophia to subject her to a glass coffin test. Chloe accepts the challenge in hopes of earning the family's acceptance, not knowing Sophia has sealed the air holes with desiccant. As she pleads for help on a livestream, her brothers dismiss her cries as an act, and she suffocates. When they later learn she had worked hard to buy them gifts, remorse sets in. Sophia receives a death sentence for murder, but Chloe's soul has already departed, declaring she wants no further family ties.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/b1aeb54007e56597/zh_TW/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/b1aeb54007e56597/zh_TW/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtynq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-died-in-a-glass-coffin-and-my-brothers-lost-their-minds_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtynq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-died-in-a-glass-coffin-and-my-brothers-lost-their-minds_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtynq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-died-in-a-glass-coffin-and-my-brothers-lost-their-minds_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtynq/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable